      "autoHeightenLevel": 1,
      "cantrips": [
        {
          "name": "Electric Arc",
          "type": "cantrip",
          "level": 1,
          "traits": [
            "concentrate",
            "electricity",
            "manipulate"
          ],
          "castingTime": "2",
          "duration": "",
          "range": "30 feet",
          "area": "",
          "targets": "1 or 2 creatures",
          "save": "basic reflex",
          "description": "<p>An arc of lightning leaps from one target to another. Each target takes <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">2d4</span> electricity damage with a basic Reflex save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">1d4</span>.</p>",
          "cast": false,
          "cost": "",
          "primaryCheck": "",
          "secondaryCasters": "",
          "secondaryChecks": "",
          "id": "VtUpS1K0Rel7Gu8p"
        },
        {
          "name": "Frostbite",
          "type": "cantrip",
          "level": 1,
          "traits": [
            "cold",
            "concentrate",
            "manipulate"
          ],
          "castingTime": "2",
          "duration": "",
          "range": "60 feet",
          "area": "",
          "targets": "1 creature",
          "save": "basic fortitude",
          "description": "<p>An orb of biting cold coalesces around your target, freezing its body. The target takes <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">2d4</span> cold damage with a basic Fortitude save. On a critical failure, the target also gains weakness 1 to bludgeoning until the start of your next turn.</p>\n\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">1d4</span> and the weakness on a critical failure increases by 1.</p>",
          "cast": false,
          "cost": "",
          "primaryCheck": "",
          "secondaryCasters": "",
          "secondaryChecks": "",
          "id": "yCiaTl3GnCkbKxaE"
        },
        {
          "name": "Gouging Claw",
          "type": "cantrip",
          "level": 1,
          "traits": [
            "attack",
            "concentrate",
            "manipulate",
            "morph"
          ],
          "castingTime": "2",
          "duration": "",
          "range": "touch",
          "area": "",
          "targets": "1 creature",
          "save": "",
          "description": "<p>You temporarily morph your limb into a clawed appendage. Make a melee spell attack roll against your target's AC. If you hit, you deal your choice of <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">2d6</span> slashing damage or <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">2d6</span> piercing damage, plus 2 persistent bleed damage. On a critical success, you deal double damage and double bleed damage.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">1d6</span> and the persistent bleed damage increases by 1.</p>",
          "cast": false,
          "cost": "",
          "primaryCheck": "",
          "secondaryCasters": "",
          "secondaryChecks": "",
          "id": "TRkG4COVv834Fe3D"
        },
        {
          "name": "Guidance",
          "type": "cantrip",
          "level": 1,
          "traits": [
            "concentrate"
          ],
          "castingTime": "1",
          "duration": "until the start of your next turn",
          "range": "30 feet",
          "area": "",
          "targets": "1 creature",
          "save": "",
          "description": "<p>You ask for the guidance of supernatural entities, granting the target a +1 status bonus to one attack roll, Perception check, saving throw, or skill check the target attempts before the duration ends. The target chooses which roll to use the bonus on before rolling. If the target uses the bonus, the spell ends. Either way, the target is then temporarily immune for 1 hour.</p>\n\n",
          "cast": false,
          "cost": "",
          "primaryCheck": "",
          "secondaryCasters": "",
          "secondaryChecks": "",
          "id": "yvsMWzzEZtHGlw9d"
        },
        {
          "name": "Ignition",
          "type": "cantrip",
          "level": 1,
          "traits": [
            "attack",
            "concentrate",
            "fire",
            "manipulate"
          ],
          "castingTime": "2",
          "duration": "",
          "range": "30 feet",
          "area": "",
          "targets": "1 creature",
          "save": "",
          "description": "<p>You snap your fingers and point at a target, which begins to smolder. Make a spell attack roll against the target's AC, dealing <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">2d4</span> fire damage on a hit. If the target is within your melee reach, you can choose to make a melee spell attack with the flame instead of a ranged spell attack, which increases all the spell's damage dice to d6s.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target takes double damage and <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">1d4</span> persistent fire damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes full damage.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The initial damage increases by <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">1d4</span> and the persistent fire damage on a critical hit increases by <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">1d4</span>.</p>\n<p>Scaling Persistent Fire Damage</p>\n<p>Scaling Persistent Fire Damage (Melee)</p>",
          "cast": false,
          "cost": "",
          "primaryCheck": "",
          "secondaryCasters": "",
          "secondaryChecks": "",
          "id": "G5oz4nCzBkJeu7kH"
        }
      ],
