          "range": "",
          "area": "15 ft cone",
          "targets": "",
          "save": "reflex",
          "description": "<p>A cone of icy shards bursts from your spread hands and coats the targets in a layer of frost. You deal <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">2d4</span> cold damage to creatures in the area; they must each attempt a Reflex save.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes half damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes full damage and takes a –5-foot status penalty to its Speeds for 2 rounds.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature takes double damage and takes a –10-foot status penalty to its Speeds for 2 rounds.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">2d4</span>.</p>",
